#: ../../provisioning/kubernetes/spec_blueprint.rst:9
msgid ""
"The Kubernetes Spec blueprint type allows deploying raw Kubernetes YAML "
"manifests as |morpheus| Apps. Unlike Helm charts which use templating, "
"Kubernetes Spec blueprints deploy standard Kubernetes resource "
"definitions directly. This is managed by the "
"``KubernetesAppTemplateService``."
msgstr "Der Blueprint-Typ Kubernetes Spec ermöglicht das Bereitstellen roher Kubernetes-YAML-Manifeste als |morpheus|-Apps. Im Gegensatz zu Helm Charts, die Templating verwenden, stellen Kubernetes-Spec-Blueprints Standard-Kubernetes-Ressourcendefinitionen direkt bereit. Dies wird vom ``KubernetesAppTemplateService`` verwaltet."

